        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="35" value="• Invitation statuses PENDING/ACCEPTED/REJECTED/CANCELLED; no expiry or EXPIRED status. External invite is Kỳ 2.&lt;br/&gt;• Accept response and activation while Redis snapshot is pending remain open. Account ACTIVE lookup is not integrated safely.&lt;br/&gt;• Membership roles and IDs live in board_db; userId is UUID scalar, not a cross-database FK." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=9;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#d6b656;fillColor=#fff2cc;" vertex="1" parent="1">
