        <mxCell id="35" value="• Cursor scope is Project/Board/Column + sort; response shape/errors open. Client dedupes cardId and shows reload banner when inconsistent.&lt;br/&gt;• Task keeps project_id/board_id/column_id as scalar references; no FK to board_db. Path projectId alone does not prove Board relation.&lt;br/&gt;• SYSTEM_ADMIN alone has no Project access. Runtime Card status exists, but target semantics are open." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=9;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#d6b656;fillColor=#fff2cc;" vertex="1" parent="1">
