          <mxGeometry x="1465" y="110" width="200" height="54" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="28" value="&lt;b&gt;RabbitMQ&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fillColor=#f5f8fb;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1750" y="110" width="200" height="54" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="29" value="• Revocation becomes effective when Redis applies the new snapshot; DB commit alone does not claim old authorization stopped.&lt;br/&gt;• A newer Redis authorizationVersion makes old job SUPERSEDED, not COMPLETED. Task reads Redis and fails closed on missing/invalid/unavailable snapshots.&lt;br/&gt;• Task unassign is independent and retryable; failure never restores access or delays revoke completion." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=9;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#d6b656;fillColor=#fff2cc;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="803" width="1910" height="156" as="geometry" />
