        <mxCell id="28" value="• Current GET/PATCH controller uses X-User-Id stub; inbound ports not fully wired. Internal POST is disabled by default and has no service-token enforcement.&lt;br/&gt;• TaskEventListener is placeholder; Card event names, payloads, queue bindings and notification event flow are not agreed/wired.&lt;br/&gt;• Account inbox can aggregate across Projects and system notifications without Project context." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=9;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#d6b656;fillColor=#fff2cc;" vertex="1" parent="1">
